# K03 NS-ROLES-3: `Model: fresh` in a method, Model existing and fresh unknown, is Model's call with fresh, refused
# where it stands (docs/LMX_semantics.en.md:668); a fresh instance is the written construction `fresh: merge: Model`.
Model:
    size_t: value 1U
end: Model
fn: m () int
    Model: fresh
    return: 7
end: m
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: m(); stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
